#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:72
#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:79
msgid "Fullcone NAT"
msgstr "全锥型 NAT"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic.json:3
msgid "Grant access to fullcone firewall settings"
msgstr "授予访问全锥型防火墙设置的权限"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:81
msgid ""
"Uses all supported protocols. Enabling Fullcone NAT automatically enables "
"IPv4 and IPv6 masquerading; disabling it restores the previous settings. "
"Usually enable this only on the WAN zone."
msgstr ""
"使用所有受支持的协议。启用全锥型NAT时自动开启 IPv4 和 IPv6 地址伪装；关闭时恢"
"复原有设置。通常仅需在 WAN 区域开启。"

#: package/emortal/luci-app-fullconenat-sonic/htdocs/luci-static/resources/tools/fullconenat-sonic.js:82
msgid ""
"Uses all supported protocols. Enabling Fullcone NAT automatically enables "
"IPv4 masquerading; disabling it restores the previous settings. Usually "
"enable this only on the WAN zone."
msgstr ""
"使用所有受支持的协议。启用全锥型NAT时自动开启 IPv4 地址伪装；关闭时恢复原有设"
"置。通常仅需在 WAN 区域开启。"
